 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Textract API (2018-06-27). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Adapters are stored configuration with no adapter versions: nothing is trained, evaluated or applied to a document, so CreateAdapterVersion and the other adapter version operations return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Document text detection, analysis, expense, identity and lending operations and their asynchronous jobs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. ListAdapters refuses creation time filters.",
  "title": "Amazon Textract (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-06-27"
 },
